      "Q": {
        "slot": "Q",
        "id": "HeimerdingerQ",
        "name": "H-28 G Evolution Turret",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Heimerdinger lays down a rapid-fire cannon turret equipped with a secondary pass-through beam attack (turrets deal half damage to towers).",
        "bodyHtml": "Heimerdinger constructs a <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Turret</span> that attacks nearby enemies. Heimerdinger can have 3 turrets active at once. <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Turrets</span> slowly build up charge. At max charge, they fire a stronger attack.<br /><br />If Heimerdinger gets too far away, his <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Turrets</span> will deactivate after 8 seconds.<br /><br />This Ability has 3 charges.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Turrets prioritize attacking enemies Heimerdinger has recently damaged and enemies attacking Heimerdinger.<br /><br />Turret Stats:<br /><span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(5/41% Ability Power) Health</span><br /><span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(7/11/15/19/23 + (35% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> per regular shot<br /><span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(40/60/80/100/120 + (55% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> per charged shot</span>",
