        "name": "CH-2 Electron Storm Grenade",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Heimerdinger lobs a grenade at a location, dealing damage to enemy units, as well as stunning anyone directly hit and slowing surrounding units.",
        "bodyHtml": "Heimerdinger hurls a grenade that deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(60/100/140/180/220 + (60% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> in an area and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slows</span> by 35% for 2 seconds. Enemies in the center are also <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Stunned</span> for 1.5 seconds.<br /><br />Hitting a champion fully charges nearby <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Turrets</span>.",
