      "R": {
        "slot": "R",
        "id": "HeimerdingerR",
        "name": "UPGRADE!!!",
        "maxRank": 3,
        "summary": "Heimerdinger invents an upgrade, causing his next spell to have increased effects. ",
        "bodyHtml": "Heimerdinger upgrades his next non-ultimate Ability.<br /><br /><span>H-28Q Apex Turret:</span> Place an upgraded <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Turret</span> for 8 seconds that doesn't count towards Heimerdinger's max turrets, deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(80/100/120 + (35% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> per shot and <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(100/140/180 + (70% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> per charged shot. Its attacks deal damage in an area, <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slow</span> by 25% for 2 seconds, and it is immune to crowd control.<br /><br /><span>Hextech Rocket Swarm:</span> Fires 4 waves of rockets that each deal <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(135/180/225 + (45% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>. Champions and jungle monsters hit by additional rockets take reduced damage, and minions take increased damage. Max Damage: <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(503/697.5/892 + (183% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>. <br /><br /><span>CH-3X Lightning Grenade:</span> Throws a bouncing grenade that discharges three times, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(100/200/300 + (60% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>. The <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Stun</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slow</span> areas are larger.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast:</span> Cancel this Ability.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">The upgraded Ability has no cost.<br />Upgraded rockets deal 2000% damage to minions.<br /><br />Apex Turret Stats:<br /><span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">((725 ~ 1525) + (50% Ability Power)) Health</span><br /><span class=\"text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400\">(30 ~ 90) Armor</span><br /><span>(30 ~ 90) Magic Resist</span><br /><span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(80/100/120 + (35% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> per regular shot<br /><span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(100/140/180 + (70% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> per charged shot</span>",
